OL,3,APM's top security adviser says Europe
OL,4,Afaces hard winter to keep pressure on
OL,5,APutin
OL,6,
OL,7,FPowell said talk of Russian escalation
OL,8,Fwas "not a problem" but a "sign of
OL,9,Fsuccess" that pressure on President
OL,10,FVladimir Putin was finally paying off -
OL,11,Fand as such European nations should not
OL,12,Ftake their "foot off the gas".
OL,14,FHis optimistic remarks come as Russia
OL,15,Fcontinues to target Ukrainian
OL,16,Finfrastructure and as Europe faces a
OL,17,Fsevere energy shortage this winter
OL,18,Fafter drastically reducing its
OL,19,Fdependence on Russian oil and gas.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
